    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 12.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="12.1">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="12.1a" corresp="#wit-k">Ne on gehalgodre ænigre nunnan, ne on his gefæderan, ne on ælætan ænig Cristen man ne gewifige æfre;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">Ne on gehalgodre ænigre nunnan, ne on his gefæderan, ne on ælætan ænig Cristen man ne gewifige æfre.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And a Christian man must never marry a professed nun or his godmother or a divorced woman,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">Nor may a Christian man ever marry a professed nun, nor his godmother, nor a divorced woman.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Noch verheirathe sich ein christlicher Mann je mit einer eingesegneten Nonne oder mit seiner Gevatterin, noch mit einer Geschiedenen;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Nor let any Christian man ever marry a consecrated nun, or his godmother [co-sponsor], or a divorced woman;</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:VIAtr_39">VI Atr 39</ref>; <ref target="clause:ICn_7-1">I Cn 7.1</ref>; <ref target="clause:Northu_61-1">Northu 61.1</ref></note>
      </div>
    </body>
